- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/MemberId.java` — owns the format `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` and reads segments back. Build method:
```java
public static String of(String region, int fiscalYearSegment, String normalizedTelephone, String lastName) {
    String base = region
        + String.format("%0" + FISCAL_YEAR_LENGTH + "d", fiscalYearSegment)   // 2-digit FY
        + Sha256.hexPrefix(normalizedTelephone + lastName, HASH_LENGTH);       // HASH8 = 8 upper hex
    return base + Luhn.checkDigit(base);                                       // 1 Luhn check digit
}
```
Read-back: `regionOf(memberId)` = everything before the fixed 11-char trailing part (`FY`=2 + `HASH8`=8 + `CHK`=1 = `TRAILING_LENGTH` 11), ignoring any `-<n>` de-dup suffix. `fiscalYearSegmentOf(memberId)` = the two digits right after the region.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/MemberIdGenerator.java` (`@Component`) — orchestrates and de-duplicates:
```java
public String generate(Owner owner) {
    String region = Locality.of(owner.getCity(), owner.getPostcode());
    int fiscalYearSegment = FiscalYear.yearSegment(RegistrationDatePolicy.effectiveDate(owner.getRegistrationDate()));
    String memberId = MemberId.of(region, fiscalYearSegment, owner.getTelephone(), owner.getLastName());
    return deduplicate(memberId);   // appends "-2", "-3", ... on collision via ownerRepository.existsByMemberId
}
```
Supporting utils:
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/Luhn.java` — `checkDigit(value)` over the digits only.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/FiscalYear.java` — FY starts 1 July, numbered by the year it ends; `yearSegment` = FY % 100; `label` = `"FY%02d"`.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/RegistrationDatePolicy.java` — `effectiveDate()` defaults null→today and rolls weekends/holidays forward; feeds the FY segment.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/TextNormalizer.java` — trim, collapse whitespace, lower-case (used by householdId and namesake counting; NOT by identityKey/memberId telephone).

