## 2. Owner response DTO / shape

The response DTO (`OwnerDto`) is generated from the `Owner` schema in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` (lines 2121-2379). It is `OwnerFields` (lines 2001-2120) plus these read-only derived fields. Field list:

From `OwnerFields` (also request-writable): `title` (enum MR/MRS/MS/DR), `firstName`, `lastName`, `address`, `addressLine1`, `addressLine2`, `city`, `postcode`, `telephone`, `email`, `birthDate`, `registrationDate`, `sharesHousehold` (bool, not persisted).

Added read-only in `Owner`: `id`, `selfLink` (`/api/owners/{id}`), `displayName` (`"Last, First"`), `salutation`, `telephoneDisplay`, `memberId`, `fiscalYear` (`FY27`), `membershipPoints`, `membershipLevel` (1-4), `householdId`, `identityKey`, `initials`, **`locality`** (e.g. `NSW`), **`timezone`** (e.g. `Australia/Sydney`), `namesakeCount`, `bulkSignupWarning`, `capacityWarning`, `possibleDuplicate`, `possibleDuplicateOf`, `riskFlag`, `contactPreference` (EMAIL/PHONE), `ownerSegment` (enum PREMIUM_METRO / PREMIUM_REGIONAL / STANDARD_METRO / STANDARD_REGIONAL), `ageBand` (MINOR/ADULT/SENIOR), `deleted`, `pets` (required).

There is NO `apiVersion` field in the current schema (grep for `apiVersion` hits only the test). `locality` and `timezone` are both present.

The actual field getters live in the entity `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`. Key derived getters:
```java
public String getLocality() {              // read back from member id, not recomputed
    return MemberId.regionOf(this.memberId);
}
public String getTimezone() {
    return RegionTimezone.zoneFor(getLocality());
}
public String getFiscalYear() {
    Integer yearSegment = MemberId.fiscalYearSegmentOf(this.memberId);
    return yearSegment == null ? null : FiscalYear.label(yearSegment);
}
public String getPrimaryIdentifier() { return getMemberId(); }   // used by audit event
public String getIdentityKey() {
    String key = String.join("|",
        this.telephone == null ? "" : this.telephone,
        this.email == null ? "" : this.email.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT),
        Soundex.encode(getLastName()));
    return Sha256.hex(key);
}
public String getOwnerSegment() {
    return OwnerSegment.of(getMembershipLevel(), getLocality());
}
```
The mapper `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (MapStruct) maps entity→`OwnerDto` and computes `selfLink`, `displayName`, `telephoneDisplay`; also builds `OwnerPageDto` for V2.

